WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.856 --> 00:00:06.882
We exist here at the Stanford Executive
Program to help you change your life and

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:10.992
in the process change
the organization you lead in and

00:00:10.992 --> 00:00:14.937
change the world you touch,
that's why we exist.

00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:17.949
Our curriculum, it gives you content.

00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:21.101
It gives you ideas, but more than that,

00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:25.197
it helps you understand
the meaning of leadership.

00:00:25.197 --> 00:00:32.683
Leadership is much more than knowledge
of functional activities or skills.

00:00:32.683 --> 00:00:36.098
Leadership is an honor, and with honor,

00:00:36.098 --> 00:00:40.400
comes duty,
the duty to create your organization.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.039
A context that will help them thrive
in ways they never dreamed of.

00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:54.293
Come here to Stanford to fulfill
that view of your role as a leader.

00:00:54.293 --> 00:00:59.790
[MUSIC]

